<view class="page-shell weekly-page"><view class="eyebrow">A WEEK IN STARS · 本周星光</view><view class="weekly-title">给这一周，留一页回望</view><view class="weekly-range">{{review.label}} · {{review.key}}</view><view class="weekly-theme"><view class="theme-kicker">本周主题</view><view class="theme-title">{{review.theme.title}}</view><view class="theme-line">{{review.theme.line}}</view><view class="theme-action">{{review.theme.action}}</view></view><view class="pack-heading"><view><view class="weekly-section-title">本周主题卡包</view><view class="pack-note">{{review.packDoneCount}} / {{review.pack.cards.length}} 张已完成</view></view><text>每周更新</text></view><view class="weekly-pack"><view wx:for="{{review.pack.cards}}" wx:key="id" class="pack-card"><view class="pack-index">0{{index + 1}}</view><view class="pack-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="pack-text">{{item.text}}</view><action-followup card="{{item}}" compact="{{true}}" bind:statuschange="actionChanged"/></view></view><view class="weekly-stats"><view><view class="weekly-stat-value">{{review.actionCount}}</view><view>收下小行动</view></view><view><view class="weekly-stat-value">{{review.doneCount}}</view><view>完成小行动</view></view><view><view class="weekly-stat-value">{{review.favoriteCount}}</view><view>收藏卡片</view></view></view><view class="weekly-section-title">这一周留下的方向</view><block wx:if="{{review.recentActions.length}}"><view wx:for="{{review.recentActions}}" wx:key="id" class="weekly-action"><view class="weekly-action-date">{{item.date}}</view><view class="weekly-action-title">{{item.title}}</view><action-followup action="{{item}}" compact="{{true}}" bind:statuschange="actionChanged"/></view></block><view wx:else class="weekly-empty"><view class="empty-symbol">✦</view><view>还没有收下小行动</view><view class="empty-copy">先去今日卡或星光骰子，给这一周留下一点方向。</view></view><view class="weekly-links"><button class="primary-button" bindtap="openHome">回到今日卡</button><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="openDice">摇一个本周方向</button><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="openPair">和某个人一起看看</button></view><view class="weekly-footnote">本周记录只保存在当前设备 · 不代表运势或评判</view></view>
